   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "These five agents were added 2026-10-19. **alertwatch** triages Alertmanager alerts (event-driven), **weekrollup** writes the Friday digest + agent quality check, **patchrun** applies approved OS security patches, **agentdemo** contrasts a safe vs a hijacked AI agent against the owned crAPI training lab, and **llmredteam** evaluates the LiteLLM guardrail. See also [Daily Reports](/d/agent-daily-reports) and the [report index](http://192.168.1.98:9440/reports/)."
   },
